  <entry>
    <title>AI</title>
    <id>https://pype.dev/ai/</id>
    <updated>2026-02-05T20:58:00Z</updated>
    <published>2026-02-05T20:58:00Z</published>
    <link href="https://pype.dev/ai/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"></link>
    <summary type="text">How do I use AI for my site?</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;How do I use AI for my site?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Cover images - I generate these with Stable Diffusion running on my desktop, the prompts sometimes comes from basically dropping my blog post into Ollama/Open-WebUI and getting a prompt back to make an image that fits the vibe&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Breaking up raw blog posts by heading - AI never writes my posts for me, but sometimes with longer ramblings I will have an agent just break up by new lines with headings to help me group the thoughts together&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Site asthetic - my site is built with &lt;a href=&#34;https://markata.dev&#34;&gt;markata&lt;/a&gt; but the templates (jinja, html, css) I have given almost fully over to AI because web-design isn&amp;rsquo;t something I&amp;rsquo;m deeply interested in, but I like to write and the agents have helped me make my blog look more personal (I recognize some people might take offense to this - we can happily fight about it over a drink sometime :p)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My main thing to say is that I don&amp;rsquo;t ever intend to put AI words in front of another human without full transparency like in &lt;a href=&#34;/the-importance-of-nostr-according-to-chatgpt/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;The Importance of Nostr According to ChatGPT&#34; data-description=&#34;This was written by ChatGPT with zero oversight from me. There are a few things that are not 100% accurate, but the main idea is there... I am hoping to...&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-01-24&#34; data-preview=&#34;This was written by ChatGPT with zero oversight from me. There are a few things that are not 100% accurate, but the main idea is there... I am hoping to...&#34;&gt;The Importance of Nostr According to ChatGPT&lt;/a&gt;, but I am using AI to craft my blog and help me organize myself&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</content>
    <author>
      <name>Nic Payne</name>
      <uri>https://pype.dev</uri>
    </author>
  </entry>
