  <entry>
    <title>About Me</title>
    <id>https://pype.dev/slash-pages/</id>
    <updated>2025-06-13T20:58:00Z</updated>
    <published>2025-06-13T20:58:00Z</published>
    <link href="https://pype.dev/slash-pages/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"></link>
    <summary type="text">Hey, I&#39;m Nic. Welcome to my little corner of the internet.</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 id=&#34;about-me&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;About Me&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hey, I&amp;rsquo;m Nic. Welcome to my little corner of the internet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m a platform engineer who loves homelabbing, automation, and figuring out how things work. I also write about faith, life, and whatever&amp;rsquo;s on my mind.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-this-site&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;What is this site?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#what-is-this-site&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This is my public mental datalake—a space where I share thoughts on technology, faith, and life. The posts here range from technical tutorials to personal reflections.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;slash-pages&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Slash Pages&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#slash-pages&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You might have noticed URLs like &lt;code&gt;/now&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/uses&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;/about&lt;/code&gt;. These are called &lt;a href=&#34;https://slashpages.net/&#34;&gt;slash pages&lt;/a&gt; — a simple, elegant way to share information about yourself using just a URL.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;They&amp;rsquo;re inspired by the &amp;ldquo;slash&amp;rdquo; convention popularized by people like Derek Sivers. Instead of having to navigate through menus, you can just share a link like &lt;code&gt;pype.dev/uses&lt;/code&gt; and people instantly see what tech I use.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;my-slash-pages&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;My Slash Pages&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#my-slash-pages&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here are some of my slash pages:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/now&#34;&gt;/now&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — What I&amp;rsquo;m currently focused on&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/uses&#34;&gt;/uses&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — My current setup and tools&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/wants&#34;&gt;/wants&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — Things I&amp;rsquo;m hoping to get/do&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/about&#34;&gt;/about&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — More about who I am&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/contact&#34;&gt;/contact&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — How to reach me&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/feeds&#34;&gt;/feeds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — Other feeds I follow&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can also browse all my slash pages at &lt;a href=&#34;/slash&#34;&gt;/slash&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;how-to-reach-me&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;How to Reach Me&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#how-to-reach-me&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Email: &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:nic@pype.dev&#34;&gt;nic@pype.dev&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;GitHub: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/pypeaday&#34;&gt;pypeaday&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Digital Harbor: &lt;a href=&#34;https://mydigitalharbor.com/pypeaday&#34;&gt;pypeaday&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thanks for stopping by!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</content>
