    <link href="https://pype.dev/now/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"></link>
    <summary type="text">Started on 2025-07-16-notes using this page for my &#34;don&#39;t lose sight of the projects you&#39;re touching&#34;</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Started on &lt;a href=&#34;/2025-07-16-notes/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;2025-07-16 Notes&#34; data-description=&#34;yesterday - 2025-07-15-notes&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-07-16&#34; data-preview=&#34;yesterday - 2025-07-15-notes&#34;&gt;2025-07-16 Notes&lt;/a&gt; using this page for my &amp;ldquo;don&amp;rsquo;t lose sight of the projects you&amp;rsquo;re touching&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;writing&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Writing&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#writing&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;/gods-zeal-for-justice-amont-men-displayed-in-the-divine-counsel/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;God&amp;#39;s Zeal for Justice Amont Men Displayed in the Divine Counsel&#34; data-description=&#34;link to sermon&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-05-31&#34; data-preview=&#34;link to sermon&#34;&gt;God&#39;s Zeal for Justice Amont Men Displayed in the Divine Counsel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/desktop-crash-2026/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Desktop Crash 2026&#34; data-description=&#34;Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-04-22&#34; data-preview=&#34;Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.&#34;&gt;Desktop Crash 2026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/desktop-setup-2026/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Desktop Setup 2026&#34; data-description=&#34;after desktop-crash-2026 I need to set new things up, I&amp;#39;ll track work here&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-04-26&#34; data-preview=&#34;after desktop-crash-2026 I need to set new things up, I&amp;#39;ll track work here&#34;&gt;Desktop Setup 2026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/dataops/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;DataOps&#34; data-description=&#34;old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-05-07&#34; data-preview=&#34;old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory&#34;&gt;DataOps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;/panicking-led-to-losing-my-desktop/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Panicking Led to Losing My Desktop&#34; data-description=&#34;I thought I had backups handled... can you imagine how the rest of this post is going to go with that intro?&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-05-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;I thought I had backups handled... can you imagine how the rest of this post is going to go with that intro?&#34;&gt;Panicking Led to Losing My Desktop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;note on &lt;a href=&#34;/blog-and-llm-knowledge-base/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Blog and LLM Knowledge Base&#34; data-description=&#34;Thinking about this tweet from Andrej Karpathy about LLM knowledge bases. I maintain a blog like this one at work, which is fairly well structured markdown...&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-05-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;Thinking about this tweet from Andrej Karpathy about LLM knowledge bases. I maintain a blog like this one at work, which is fairly well structured markdown...&#34;&gt;Blog and LLM Knowledge Base&lt;/a&gt;, should turn this into a plan&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;doing it at work?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;lost-but-potentially-recoverable&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Lost but potentially recoverable&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#lost-but-potentially-recoverable&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[[consider-the-point]]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[[self-hosting-a-code-forge-with-&lt;a href=&#34;/forgejo/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;self-hosted code forge - codeberg - fork of gittea&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;forgejo&#34;&gt;forgejo&lt;/a&gt;]]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[[should-data-models-be-fat]]&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I want to start writing about some parenting concepts&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;discipline vs consequences vs punishment is one concept&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;/consequences-discipline-and-punishment/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Consequences, Discipline, and Punishment&#34; data-description=&#34;I&amp;#39;m a dad and I have 2 beautiful daughters in my house right now. As they&amp;#39;ve grown up just a little from new-born to toddler to child, my wife and I have...&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-02-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;I&amp;#39;m a dad and I have 2 beautiful daughters in my house right now. As they&amp;#39;ve grown up just a little from new-born to toddler to child, my wife and I have...&#34;&gt;Consequences, Discipline, and Punishment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;love and the &amp;ldquo;greater will&amp;rdquo; for your child&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;goes hand-in-hand with something like &amp;ldquo;it&amp;rsquo;s good for your child to suffer&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;hot&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Hot&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#hot&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;bookorbit for Kassia&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/notifiq/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Notifiq&#34; data-description=&#34;Note: this began in event-details-updates-via-notifications-as-a-service and is the first iteration of this idea&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-12-26&#34; data-preview=&#34;Note: this began in event-details-updates-via-notifications-as-a-service and is the first iteration of this idea&#34;&gt;Notifiq&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/soonish/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Soonish&#34; data-description=&#34;Personal events tracker dashboard&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-09-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;Personal events tracker dashboard&#34;&gt;Soonish&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/mindful/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Mindful&#34; data-description=&#34;Reminder and alarm app&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-12-26&#34; data-preview=&#34;Reminder and alarm app&#34;&gt;Mindful&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/quadtask/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;QuadTask&#34; data-description=&#34;Eisenhower Matrix based task manager&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-06-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;Eisenhower Matrix based task manager&#34;&gt;QuadTask&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/qr-harbor/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;QR Harbor&#34; data-description=&#34;The QR side of Digital Harbor&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-12-26&#34; data-preview=&#34;The QR side of Digital Harbor&#34;&gt;QR Harbor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;/cannalyze/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Cannalyze&#34; data-description=&#34;A self-hostable habit tracker with special attention given to gardening habits&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-12-27&#34; data-preview=&#34;A self-hostable habit tracker with special attention given to gardening habits&#34;&gt;Cannalyze&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;josh&amp;rsquo;s site redirects still, it isn&amp;rsquo;t his url so I still need to fix that&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;bugs&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;BUGS&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#bugs&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;repoflow bug&amp;hellip; when my library is set to private, I can login and push from forgejo with my bot account. if I make the library public, then the push fails from forgejo with 401&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;runescape&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Runescape&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#runescape&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Monkey_Madness_I&#34;&gt;Monkey Madness 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;post on runelite plugins again&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;safespot the gorillas in the temple&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://cdn.statically.io/gh/pypeaday/images.pype.dev/main/blog-media/20251130112234_945c685a.png&#34; alt=&#34;20251130112234_945c685a.png&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://cdn.statically.io/gh/pypeaday/images.pype.dev/main/blog-media/20251130122758_a8f58b1b.png&#34; alt=&#34;20251130122758_a8f58b1b.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; RTB Gnome quest&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;can&amp;rsquo;t get ice gloves until 50 mining&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;got the cake&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;migrating-my-homelab-stuff-to-a-mono-repo&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Migrating my homelab stuff to a mono repo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#migrating-my-homelab-stuff-to-a-mono-repo&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://kanboard.paynepride.com/?controller=TaskViewController&amp;amp;acti