ackup scripts and when LLMs hit the scene I got interested to try to build my own. I have a pretty good understanding of...&#34;&gt;Cronicle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I built a fun self-hosted weather app &lt;a href=&#34;/dad-can-i-wear-this/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Dad, Can I Wear This?&#34; data-description=&#34;Repo&#34; data-date=&#34;2025-06-13&#34; data-preview=&#34;Repo&#34;&gt;Dad, Can I Wear This?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</content>
